# Canonical identity for history rewriting (git filter-repo --mailmap .mailmap).
# Left of the angle brackets: the identity to keep. Right: the one to replace.
#
# Swap matjablonowski@gmail.com for 1577323+jablonowski@users.noreply.github.com
# if you would rather not have the address in a public repository. Whichever you
# pick must be a verified email on the GitHub account, or the commits still will
# not attribute.
#
# GitHub's own committer identity (noreply@github.com) and github-actions[bot]
# are deliberately left alone.

